{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1210,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2db89a3cf17ecea6dfd92d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏月的时候……\r\n总觉得有种血液在骚动的感觉啊～！\r\n这就是孤独一匹狼的宿命吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff4b6f9c241d0bea1f2db823960f00de5cae57aa870938b300cb23b32ce0cdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9e7f861bb86e3ea0d358f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷！都不想离开被窝了……\r\n以前老妈都会直接把棉被给扯走。\r\n好冷好冷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95662590dc5209a158428c150cef507901b2dc8d68be2f2d9282f9bacd2793c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0b2b10d559ee24f8510da8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那家伙不开口的话还满适合的说……\r\n啊、不准告诉赤骥喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "015d7a8d449aadbd2d060c5c5509a5f30fd9a49755947964ec97271cb1e9b08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:648dccebe3b319fc1e3abf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桂冠前辈感觉……很深不可测呢。\r\n明明看起来那么温柔，但不知道\r\n为什么，总是让我背脊发凉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef093f41a67380c4aabd8be3c735e59a36e8ef00f77772b4c26db3cee88410e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbb3c21cd0a95bd1a6bd6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是白仁前辈担任圣诞老人，\r\n感觉她会直接把礼物丢进烟囱耶。\r\n唔、太帅气了～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53200e6072104f8456abf4992c8d851772a5fd2606fb1c76672f8aeee6518e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4254379d4882c5595fb0b326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被气槽前辈提醒我领带歪了，\r\n还帮我整理领带……\r\n太、太丢脸了～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d7b5dde8a17b461f650d809c2e713bc56728b49f998d885c30b2c3155b45f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a8e18e4d5a0e0ea2e17043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真弓跑来跟我说\r\n我们的决胜服配色很像……\r\n角色重复是什么意思？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43aa3d24a3d677a4fe2b9cd08f356ae9867731466ea8b34d082a7dab96b51937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bfc86135aaf9ef78eb87a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在换装时，\r\n赤骥那家伙一直不断偷瞄我……\r\n到底是怎样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "442610e97ec4f78c572162549fc4ec192eac4df8f63002d07bc377f3f3b5a690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:978edf2e5c892512dfd38311",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在圣诞节以外的日子能不能也用\r\n圣诞老人的身份有什么表现啊……\r\n像是去外送午餐之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34623d01cadbbe311abe30773814e12a0ae5b611c13f84e3f7ec7b4a9fbcd3ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f426a14e0ef3fb05b44c1a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在不夜城里奔驰的送货员……\r\n欸，不觉得听起来很酷吗？\r\n会有点向往对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aac70a8fee4791401e7a3f016ec4e85e1061d4c25c5571f1942acd4ec77358a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec590b42ae44feec58aaf0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生也会参加今年的圣诞活动吧……\r\n好，得让大家都玩得开心才行！\r\n这下我全身是劲啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b393336d2c29ff9b4df143e5fad88d6749b8743807cc28fd205c0b21ffe3d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddbed8d76f2ace6cd287b9c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说世上还有会冲浪的圣诞老人，\r\n真的假的啊……这不受常识束缚的\r\n态度，实在太帅啦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a67c31a0f851eddc8b86ebad93fdb76507f454b8b4a6d5de898589cdc73e98d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0da415a3e2b270eeb16ca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去了趟居家百货，发现店里\r\n已经开始为圣诞节做准备了。\r\n大家都很期待圣诞老人登场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "684e7fdec48d98cc3cd36f0f3cd664d1c8cb2ba3961ec547fb29b8214dd2c8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67acbf55561a3a8d5bfa8663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又来到单板滑雪的季节啦～！\r\n我快练成一个绝招了！\r\n练好后就让你在贵宾席观赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a02433ef742347f1480d2301755440432773be9af85a963613ecf0edc07721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfa83fbe61aecf747c82aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得穿着这身打扮骑摩托车\r\n很帅气吗？就像潇洒地奔驰而过的\r\n圣诞老人摩托车骑士！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e394c5aeecd2892ba47abbd751a844bab8e5a39d314e51fa312bece4d44540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7517342bb8c2ed2b2ef0e590",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家弟妹都很向往见到圣诞老人！\r\n要是我背着礼物突然回家，\r\n他们一定会很开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd323178a211e9fe634fca2eb7f1a9f7658ebf1625c49c81bd877c16be8836f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:164f3bd57fa8843fdde16892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练，就麻烦你咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08330562b38ea2e39099d0732054cd49da6ee3055531d3a2bc40e23a72dba8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d402fd53353cd7feeca18431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぜっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7040f47fe3c7f5fec78a5889a0840dad2bb2d1bb19ed5bc2f453dfee802ee79a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ea2848af29051077dd69df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要给我随便的指示哦。\r\n我可是认真以顶点为目标的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307304c539fd23278cce6ae54cc1fd7336c1281e5a4a3852e7c7d58727c7d3b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5c985cd56111d9f236a720c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我等好久了！\r\n来吧，我们赶快开始吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89f4bb850d6d8ca23cd97ca3199c7a15d13039a1b8e97bba2381fba6f850caee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e790f123825d5b13a9c6f3ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饭也吃了、也在课堂上午睡过了。\r\n好──！准备万全了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d364c36345d6e7fe8e9c947c3ccccb100e91e4977194d96bb00ca3b982fbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acd97de91de473fbeff05fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么都尽管来吧！\r\n没有什么事情……是我办不到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea052f9cb36ed10c2af61dc9d220c03e1e137f6e652ac6580bc0fcaa96f4fecf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0666ff19549139a927bd2f4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也渐渐地……\r\n开始散发出强者的气场了呢！\r\n嘿嘿，你也真是不简单啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f48b4f806f8e5cb5eb5c3574a9e79f6cac59c43b771e8a91d7ea2e9808d5ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c770948836405540e349cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会再变得更强的。\r\n你可要紧紧跟上，不要被甩开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea867e8d0254d025090404e160e71a76c6871d05bcdf46883a6951368dc0d28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1669378be7607a0f5188eb9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托你严厉的指导了！\r\n……我有个绝对不想输的人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0b4e3b2214cafbf4ca27273faf181f03a80319f7258b755e9580e0ee546a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec24ef19e47db7745b23d920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～出发啰！\r\n管它积雪路还是一片漆黑我都不怕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be9e657b33a7e50039e777efb7827a060df21b8a87fdf098bbcf7d38d6d3bb30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d202a1b3adb54dd574282749",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己就能身兼圣诞老人跟麋鹿了，\r\n训练员就……负责为我加油吧！\r\n很好，交给你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61c58d3dc7a04b9efb66fd0eff70157a433753b5e8de03625bd6c596125ba77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c429886f61d0aad7d96e6390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "扛着沉重的礼物袋到处跑，\r\n应该会是不错的训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2ca777417f830206eaea7a0d1b20c3c87983d8953ab7bd227c4414225142fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508f626418b148137e306ce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这身打扮跑步，\r\n小朋友看了都很开心呢。\r\n训练起来也更有干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8439a2bb31ca3756b3d5a684b759b3c54393b9bc351a3875c2760796197e62bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c994feb2b50a78c74c22b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要尽情闪耀，\r\n让所有人都看得目不转睛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b46c40175c9b571d128ddab9688dfea9359f42a47532866bc21eef769095cad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862bbd2358d200b3a70a4cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，训练完后去吃火鸡吧！\r\n要大口大口、狂野地吃肉！\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c309aa67a8ca2e388b23974128e3f69d2eb1656b5e156f0362f449327ba39a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818b75ca1c3bd40f7e824905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，伙伴！\r\n一起追求能跑遍世界的脚力吧！\r\n大朋友小朋友一定都等不及了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f350f494390d9cce8d9553ca5a412665dab3f84c54b88eb3cda2f5d45c161116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8161383dc9d5aaf26949bbda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿！真不愧是我的伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bdd8f4cb5cacc02d3186d128d6ca0483cd3e7cf66a29eacd07b3f27133b024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47af1900608abc0e8c96c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚很帅吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c17ffc25db95d828f37252b86bfd9e14778af7bb06c2a7789f4d5533abe3ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa8d2954d7597aa33b18bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真是最棒的礼物了，对吧？伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad65777c15f3c5f798008173609b480ecee92891362829a92c13a9d68cdf447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d49166bb9a28b32593a165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的圣诞老人打扮怎么样？嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f36eb54224d183ca6c12230ab63e37494b78dda6adcdc375e6e440ab80f13a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0caa8000e782101a5fab97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──！感觉热血起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5911c21fa68e5c50b018ec5de9ddd1a937ad9db3b6cb85b4471556c7a923a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50215d97c9e942574db1c74f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会跑出……\r\n超越仪表盘的速、度、的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce809111f20cb5c2b44d730180f5a4b807a12938ec77940ab6a2b9f85357e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9306f3bff1fa8d8a0beb377c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔！我是伏特加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd771e2691868717c0bcb59d14ad6fd30f33dc0d81a310f9997bab7471520b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6d6d096736dea02dcb2ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f99e199832724c348e9078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以再更依靠我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ac16a89bc48ebeda5b0dc420a480f2d86a125eccaf5214a53d906c220f38c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4473bdc781f79c4f944f6caa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪开闪开！圣诞老人要冲刺啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd011fb81c201bc41a4767a3fb798d9c98bf90b7fb33f2e3b918b045ee47111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acfc36ab6640e6d95ba0f4ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传递梦想的圣诞老人\r\n没有任何极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a9f1ebfd4b7f13261fdac239b8fb403cc15107f3921cdcbe8d1465ea40e183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade896abead6763cfcdc0b43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乖乖等着吧，\r\n我立刻把梦想送到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea32069b5240ba6059d432e34efd98ffc9a0cca6dc3e2b58570a5ceda6e9a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e962b934bd596ac31c1d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是伏特加！一起去送礼物吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35262376327e93a6a0c832da4307ea8d5f25c72736123b065241f129be13913",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8ffc4d3aaba54b93cf7b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fc8ca2fdad80f82735337a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还真是个奇怪的家伙呢。\r\n居然想要支持我什么的。\r\n…虽然我也不觉得讨厌就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dc784600ce404de2c4d28e3f67a1bb0a1b2ca912d64c25f513e57fe91bd3c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f22353c569696d690534829c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c82872d8a468c7ad7b36546080de7121f477614ca965a9aed5b1ce585843d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97a1c57f074bdc38bc5a3565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da7c504c28f7f358af208cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是要成为第一的赛马娘的。\r\n你也要好好地跟上我，\r\n成为最棒的训练员哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "489e5987fb0388ba9436b3d6846dd7637ace6ed05a49b576666f544ec27b0619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948ce3bf109f5f6f69a4ac8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使这样，\r\n我还是稍微有些依赖你的哦…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc484339b54aaf4252dca4dfe7f0363888b9b802bee9439d7ea71d6ac3039694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050f86686d60dd73e692c8bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年也要以第一名为目标，\r\n所以就算是正月也不能懈怠哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a74eda433598aa572a91fa22fae6b17f39361760067e0939aa4cdb273f5867e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ca2cc69084249d10584cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力？你想要的话我一会儿就给你。\r\n呵呵，你最豪华的回礼，\r\n我可是很期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5177019a9a19de484ebf3d1fa4a2ae04b0191c4d94bfffea6240174caffbee4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55190b2abf2b3a8f4725d28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你。情人节巧克力。\r\n先、先说好了，这不过是义理巧克力而已！\r\n…嘛，只是稍微有些特别罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d246de1de8d1d44158a3434e80089b689c6db0de57e7a5948be26ff823229ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d1dd243b8d50d150285991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在纸条上写好了要许的愿望吗？\r\n我已经写完了哟。\r\n内容当然是“成为第一名”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3637afd1b0c620baa02ee652fbb284a76266bdcbc7a0758a18d0a58bcc0d1690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0b902d645eb9aaa45edaff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的万圣节，\r\n做什么点心好呢……\r\n你也想要？真拿你没办法啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "046f3e5927608723bc50332c2e7a75b64f14e199a67b239cb505902e402943d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081561a4ec26616e66bb5102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年圣诞节，妈妈都会送我花束。\r\n选择的花语也都很讲究。\r\n今年会是什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb7521efdd3e23a52708f003f4f398473672bcb01f3c6c0ff9c194b3f732d9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a83310ef82d6b9b7dad5c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你也能收到圣诞礼物的话，\r\n会很开心的吧…？\r\n不、不是要给你准备的意思哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae7ccd77fb369adec0fcfe539f71bb4dd242dd02ab0ef88bc3f79ccca87fb04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f4aba77b499429f3bdd778",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "657f4bf18314c7fbb83481a00ed708a3bb0ee30e74e5a0cf4eabd7dee76d0095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c75e832151acaf5c5535ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直以第一名为目标而努力的话，\r\n不知不觉间一年就过去了呢。\r\n明年的我也会朝着更高的目标努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1191c1b420e30a05f5c372fc5f397a35fb165f6d5efd7e2dd795327d32c72d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4774a405f823dd94d34785bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧。\r\n平时蒙受你照顾，\r\n蛋糕什么的包在我身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fbe083d7759981176221f2125ef40889d3afc3a94764d0ca781b91d7cfee0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c016270554271d67d673e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……生日快乐！\r\n我、我都给你庆祝了，\r\n至少表现得更高兴一点吧！真是的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fee87ffe33577dae9bd72e26948858f23fd64181515796c9ea094701f6c3dbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b465cfa1e947d3757812aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼…？我的生日，\r\n你记得很清楚嘛…？\r\n嘛，身为担当训练员，这也是理所当然的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6010d4fdce6c719bd58fd7c52aa5eb5e54444b9073b46eb99a1c2d087322f7e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33360fea3c2184a5415c59c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是过生日，你和大家也太过喧闹了吧……\r\n嘛，不过我也不讨厌这样就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "603cef67126770f434c7530324cc47c8fb871d7a3d2dc15a4d289866cb97b26e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b25bc8815b0ccbdd0045cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了吧。\r\n别忘了查看一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef38626b363197dc12f675134abc18dc056d28e3ed8fd4e49e470d5b044a210",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5982eb378872ffce951643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这不是有礼物送来了嘛！\r\n喂，让我也看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd24d406c2868f025cf86ce6c44333a50b1771e2e60093b490a24c6982be4d6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:111b676b51d8a583cc9fbec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了呢。\r\n可不能满足于此，下次也要继续努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b45398c6c6bfd07364a88266d236926a0df3e47f3d2a6a5855f28b36083702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1141d877854d0407149df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就要开始了哟。\r\n你已经准备好了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2077b75c49974537286c72492f50200175ceb9b93d276c8176bb1f798a260231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159c2064bf7bcdf7cfafcbba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了哟！\r\n要以第一名为目标，奔跑下去才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e715bdd0ccb1e83bf8bbe3791737fb323d80938e7c81aa166df31b4ac1dec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2147f7157eb1ef6c8d278db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会，为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf39c610f84029df96b5a053147a30f0aee18c1428189755015e3b804bdc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717a71e3b3b39028f95971c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提高了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e1f80568f1c4b950034325487d0d9bc28933b539de8ea10c9fec3d9366f54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3d640a3fac8ce8deb2b04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢白色加蓝色的服装配色。\r\n能够兼顾整洁的形象跟可爱感，\r\n再搭配荷叶边，很完美吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc6c32bae8ba18105e53cb68be9854484f89ec0b887a8c260f7f59a7c0e59fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b968e7a9b176e5f4ade6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论再怎么喜欢的衣服，\r\n都还是很快就得买新的来穿。\r\n成长实在让人又高兴又烦恼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48c3931df30c32ce944961716f4890e44efa76e4382efe9d94e47c99f2354d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6862bedb5b63524db4df18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我跟伏特加的品味一样，\r\n就可以互借衣服……不、还是不行！\r\n因为，总觉得……就是不想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18bee253d08f16f63c335736d192aed4168d363ca5ec5e8b558275e7ce8d5f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63c6a8c92b6fcaaf609186",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有这样的事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4365d6de912a5ba5ff8b3a87d677facdec7f9707bb13cb39c5df0d74afca63de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1522e71b8f7314dcdcd42a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了！是我们赢了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8d173637445618f7df030a22c0dd2d04d290970fa30382ddda004e8645ef33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1ec3085b0de347336de51b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会，为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf39c610f84029df96b5a053147a30f0aee18c1428189755015e3b804bdc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6b0bf75c213ca3b38b84e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有这样的事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4365d6de912a5ba5ff8b3a87d677facdec7f9707bb13cb39c5df0d74afca63de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b9ac2fd212cfea5fa3123d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62008c910ab5dbff1138b3dedad347b1126106d7c44ebd8e87ebbb370e41673e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6378bebfbad8ff2117dc47c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要成为第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caaea7721b84585ce03f0d596f3759be19b08dea8cc15e9771866b5e4ee574ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
